operties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Make sure that you have configured a secret for your webhook. The "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"X-Hub-Signature-256"}]},{"type":"text","value":" header will not be present if you have not configured a secret for your webhook. For more information about configuring a secret for your webhook, see "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/en/webhooks/using-webhooks/editing-webhooks"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Editing webhooks"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Make sure you are using the correct header. GitHub recommends that you use the "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"X-Hub-Signature-256"}]},{"type":"text","value":" header, which uses the HMAC-SHA256 algorithm. The "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"X-Hub-Signature"}]},{"type":"text","value":" header uses the HMAC-SHA1 algorithm and is only included for legacy purposes."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Make sure that you are using the correct algorithm. If you are using the "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"X-Hub-Signature-256"}]},{"type":"text","value":" header, you should use the HMAC-SHA256 algorithm."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Make sure you are using the correct webhook secret. If you don't know the value of your webhook secret, you can update your webhook's secret. For more information, see "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"hre